File Index

/docker notes.md
Purpose: Docker command reference for managing project containers and services.

/docker-compose.shattered-archive-experimental.yml
Purpose: This file defines an experimental Docker Compose configuration for the Shattered Archive development environment.

/docker-compose.yml
Purpose: This file defines a production-grade Docker Compose setup for deploying a multi-service web application with nginx reverse proxy and game/web clients/servers.

/game-client.Dockerfile
Purpose: This Dockerfile builds and deploys the game client application with Nginx serving the production assets.

/game-server.Dockerfile
Purpose: This Dockerfile builds and runs the game server application in a production environment.

/index.html
Purpose: This HTML file serves as a local development setup guide for the ShatteredArchive project.

/nginx.Dockerfile
Purpose: Nginx Dockerfile configuring SSL, log rotation, and custom TLS settings for edge subdomains.

/web-client.Dockerfile
Purpose: Dockerfile for building and serving the web client application with Node.js and Nginx.

/web-server.Dockerfile
Purpose: This Dockerfile builds and runs the web server application in a production environment.
